{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23842","headline":"将至东都先寄令狐留守 · 白居易","name":"将至东都先寄令狐留守","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"黄鸟无声叶满枝，闲吟想到洛城时。\n惜逢金谷三春尽，恨拜铜楼一月迟。\n诗境忽来还自得，醉乡潜去与谁期。\n东都添个狂宾客，先报壶觞风月知。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_23842.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23842","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}